# Design system: personal/professional portfolio template
Reference: brandonyasin.com (style only, never copy its code, text or images).

## Colors (put these in Tailwind theme / CSS variables, never hardcode other colors)
- bg: #645d4b (warm olive, used on every page)
- ink: #f0c040 (warm gold, all main text)
- ink-muted: gold at ~60% opacity for small meta text
- contact-bg: sage green (pick a muted sage close to #a9b39a), contact-ink: dark forest green (#1f2a1c)
- No other accent colors.

## Type
- One font family: Instrument Sans (next/font/google).
- Headings: lowercase, tight tracking (-0.03em), large (64-80px desktop, 40-48px mobile).
- Meta / nav / captions: UPPERCASE, 10-11px, tight line-height, slight letter-spacing.
- Long text on case pages: ~32-36px desktop, ~20-22px mobile.
- Decorative script monogram is an SVG only, never a script webfont for text.

## Layout & spacing
- Lots of empty space; content sits low on the page, top area mostly empty.
- 4-column header grid, small type pinned to corners.
- Spacing scale: 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64, 96px. Card gaps are tight (~6px).
- Photos are tall portrait, no rounded corners, no borders, no shadows.

## Motion
- Subtle and fast: 200-400ms for hovers, 600-1200ms for reveals, ease-out curves.
- Allowed: text roll on hover (label slides up, copy slides in), image wipe-reveal top to bottom, small lift on hover, magnetic small icons.
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion.

## Animation
- Use GSAP (with the useGSAP hook from @gsap/react) for big moments: image wipe reveals, staggered intros, horizontal scroll strip, page/menu transitions.
- Use CSS transitions for small hovers (text roll, card lift).
- Always clean up animations (useGSAP scope), register plugins once, respect prefers-reduced-motion.

## Ban list (never use)
- purple/blue gradients, any gradient backgrounds
- glassmorphism, blur cards, frosted panels
- generic icon + title + text feature cards
- rounded-2xl cards with drop shadows
- emoji in UI, stock 3D blobs, sparkles
- copy like "Elevate your business", "Unlock", "Seamless", "Empower", "Transform your vision"
- default shadcn look left unstyled
- centered hero with big headline + two buttons

## Workflow
- Every UI task starts by using the frontend-design skill in .agents/skills.
- Check every section at 1280px and 390px wide before saying done.
